Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
DidFail(): this branch's ORB-only block replaces
set_is_cors_cross_origin(true) + Fail() with CrossOriginFail(). The broader
ERR_BLOCKED_BY_RESPONSE / web-security-violation / request-blocked conditions
come from an earlier upstream change that is not on this branch and were not
added.

